                                                "sense_id": "61660c1d-c664-3623-8ce7-6c93564a0100",
                                                "text": "Some of our gentlemen officers, happening to stop at a tavern, or rather a sort of grogshop, took such a seasoning that two or three of them became “quite frisky.”"
